{"name": "Monkey Do!", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monkey Do! is a stealth action-adventure set inside a crumbling zoo run by robots and the ruthless Tropico corp. You play as Mak, a quick-witted monkey with one goal: get out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To do it, you'll need to stay hidden, scavenge for scrap, spring traps, win over the animals, and systematically make the owner's life very difficult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>STAY HIDDEN</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slip into bins, duck into haystacks, vanish into tall grass. Mak's survival depends on knowing when to move and when to disappear. The zoo's Keepers are relentless but they can't catch what they can't see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"280\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763380/extras/c33cbbd80b8ed908ee1537221c48f91e.poster.avif?t=1785789494\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763380/extras/c33cbbd80b8ed908ee1537221c48f91e.webm?t=1785789494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763380/extras/c33cbbd80b8ed908ee1537221c48f91e.mp4?t=1785789494\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DISMANTLE THE OPERATION</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mak's wrench can dismantle robot Keepers directly or he can lure them into traps to spring at exactly the right moment. The more Keepers you take apart, the better your options get.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"280\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763380/extras/27831fe30ad9801747bdd3a6b3945ac3.poster.avif?t=1785789494\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763380/extras/27831fe30ad9801747bdd3a6b3945ac3.webm?t=1785789494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763380/extras/27831fe30ad9801747bdd3a6b3945ac3.mp4?t=1785789494\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MOVE LIKE A MONKEY</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose how you approach getting past the keepers from monkey bars, air vents, ziplines and climbing walls. Leaping across habitats Mak moves through the zoo like he owns the place (Spoiler Alert: he does not own the place).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"280\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763380/extras/8f77fa2806ecefa392b52f766ea33874.poster.avif?t=1785789494\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763380/extras/8f77fa2806ecefa392b52f766ea33874.webm?t=1785789494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763380/extras/8f77fa2806ecefa392b52f766ea33874.mp4?t=1785789494\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ANIMAL ALLIANCES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The zoo's residents aren't just for show. Build trust with the animals across each habitat and they'll open routes, support your quest for freedom, and help Mak access secret areas that would otherwise be locked down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"280\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763380/extras/39c4eaa89603d283ee0d8d68b129a72a.poster.avif?t=1785789494\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763380/extras/39c4eaa89603d283ee0d8d68b129a72a.webm?t=1785789494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763380/extras/39c4eaa89603d283ee0d8d68b129a72a.mp4?t=1785789494\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ESCAPE IN STYLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When Mak arrives at the Zoo it is very much past its prime. But you can collect remnants of its heyday to unlock accessories and new fur colors to really up Mak\u2019s fashion game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"280\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763380/extras/bab4efcb6436f554c9c0a7ade7476142.poster.avif?t=1785789494\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763380/extras/bab4efcb6436f554c9c0a7ade7476142.webm?t=1785789494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763380/extras/bab4efcb6436f554c9c0a7ade7476142.mp4?t=1785789494\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>We think you'll love Monkey Do! if you enjoy\u2026</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Spyro\u2122 Reignited Trilogy,\u00a0Yooka-Replaylee,\u00a0Yooka-Laylee,\u00a0Lil Gator Game,\u00a0GEX Trilogy,\u00a0Slime Rancher,\u00a0Rayman Legends Retold and SpongeBob SquarePants: Titans of the Tide.</i>\u00a0</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Escape a crumbling zoo as Mak, a stealth-savvy monkey who dismantles robot Keepers, springs traps on them, and recruits fellow animals to stage his ultimate breakout. Will the malicious owner be able to stop him or will Mak be the monkey wrench in his operation?", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763380/7ec6790ca229bde663d7084de96922992c2afd00/header.jpg?t=1785789494", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["3D Platformer", "Collectathon", "Adventure", "Action", "Exploration", "Platformer"], "developers": "Signal Space Lab", "publishers": "Signal Space Lab", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "1763380", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "24 June 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/BU72RQbx2TM", "first_seen": 1782259200.0, "review_rank": 352}